  ($kbf$help-inventory-categories$kbf$, $kbf$Step 10c — Manage inventory categories$kbf$, $kbf$Inventory categories (Generators, Blowers, Tools…) live in the
` Manage inventory categories ` panel at the top of the
` Inventory ` page (admin only — click to expand).

- **Add** a category → it immediately shows up in the dropdown when creating/editing items

- **Rename** → the change cascades to every item that uses it (no orphans)

- **Hide** → keeps it on existing items but removes it from the dropdown (use for deprecated categories you don't want new items to land in)

- **Delete** → blocks if items are still using it. Confirm to reassign those items to "Other" then delete.

💡 This is different from `/admin/categories`, which controls
rental product categories that show on the public site. Inventory
categories are internal — customers never see them.$kbf$, $kbf$Catalog$kbf$, array[$kbf$help$kbf$, $kbf$imported$kbf$], true)
